{
 "version": 1,
 "about": "Test vectors for the private-information rules in rules.md (auto-blur, F-07/LT-05). Screen vectors are one OCR line each (optional 'above' = the line directly above in the same column). Speech vectors are caption words. Every expected hit gives kind, the exact own text (the secret's own span, never padded) and tier (auto = score >= 0.85, check = 0.50-0.85). A vector with expect [] must give no hit at all. Placeholders «...» are expanded by a seeded generator so the file never holds a string that secret scanners or push protection flag: items are separated by '|'; '=x' is literal text x; a class letter and a count is generated text (A = [A-Za-z0-9], a = [a-z0-9], H = [0-9a-f], U = [A-Z2-7], D = [0-9], L = [A-Za-z], B = [A-Za-z0-9_-], S = [A-Za-z0-9/+]); the same placeholder string in one vector always expands to the same value. Defaults: regions ['US','BD'], names [], options {randomStrings:false, dots:false}.",
